{"run_id":"run_e5c55026b3ee","schema_version":"0.1","seq":11,"t_ms":11,"text":"The Q3 2026 timesheet cutoff dates from the 2026 payroll calendar are:\n\n- **July:** The calendar says 25 July, but that date is a Saturday. Under the calendar's own weekend rule, the cutoff moves to **Friday, 24 July**. You may want to confirm this with Payroll.\n- **August:** Tuesday, 25 August\n- **September:** Friday, 25 September\n\nPayroll runs on the last business day of each month. Expense claims submitted after a cutoff are moved to the next run.","turn":3,"type":"agent.message"}
